      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Stepping out into the winter cold, Ilona immediately dials Arkady Anikeyev to report on her unexpected inspection. Convinced that the kindergarten is completely ordinary despite its quirky staff, she tells him not to worry. Inside, the undercover agents celebrate avoiding detection and dismiss their disguised operative. Let's listen to this concluding phone call in Russian first; don't worry about catching every word.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
